  'Course, I don't know why no one has mentioned the obvious-to-me
solution.  Unlike the se morji, the _te_morji is not strongly-cased to
du'u.  There is nothing wrong with saying "mi morji [zi'o?] fi lo li'i  se
tarbi"?

                             --gejyspa


